{"id":"e1e5dca961f5c9ef","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-bundle.md","title":"Fiber Bundle","display":"df-bundle — Fiber Bundle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-bundle","aliases":["58-df-bundle","Fiber Bundle"],"display":"df-bundle — Fiber Bundle","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-projection.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-bundle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-bundle</span><span>Fiber Bundle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bundle — Fiber Bundle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e8edb0ea1617bd4e\" href=\"?note=e8edb0ea1617bd4e\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-projection.md\">../batch13/58-df-projection.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B,F,\\tau_F\\in V\">\\(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B,F,\\tau_F\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall u,f\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{pr}_1(\\langle u,f\\rangle)=u\\bigr)\">\\(\\forall u,f\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{pr}_1(\\langle u,f\\rangle)=u\\bigr)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e8edb0ea1617bd4e\" href=\"?note=e8edb0ea1617bd4e\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-projection.md\">../batch13/58-df-projection.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bundle}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bundle}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bundle} \\vdash \\mathrm{Bundle}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B,F,\\tau_F)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(E,\\tau_E)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(B,\\tau_B)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(F,\\tau_F)\\land\\operatorname{Function}(p,E,B)\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_B\\;\\exists\\tau_U,\\tau_{U\\times F},\\phi_U\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;b\\in U\\land\\tau_U=\\{O\\cap p^{-1}[U]:O\\in\\tau_E\\}\\\\&amp;\\land\\tau_{U\\times F}=\\Bigl\\{W\\subseteq U\\times F:\\forall\\langle u,f\\rangle\\in W\\;\\exists O\\in\\tau_B\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau_F\\;(u\\in O\\cap U\\land f\\in V\\land(O\\cap U)\\times V\\subseteq W)\\Bigr\\}\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(\\phi_U,p^{-1}[U],\\tau_U,U\\times F,\\tau_{U\\times F})\\land\\forall e\\in p^{-1}[U]\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{pr}_1(\\phi_U(e))=p(e)\\bigr)\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bundle} \\vdash \\mathrm{Bundle}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B,F,\\tau_F)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(E,\\tau_E)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(B,\\tau_B)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(F,\\tau_F)\\land\\operatorname{Function}(p,E,B)\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_B\\;\\exists\\tau_U,\\tau_{U\\times F},\\phi_U\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;b\\in U\\land\\tau_U=\\{O\\cap p^{-1}[U]:O\\in\\tau_E\\}\\\\&amp;\\land\\tau_{U\\times F}=\\Bigl\\{W\\subseteq U\\times F:\\forall\\langle u,f\\rangle\\in W\\;\\exists O\\in\\tau_B\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau_F\\;(u\\in O\\cap U\\land f\\in V\\land(O\\cap U)\\times V\\subseteq W)\\Bigr\\}\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(\\phi_U,p^{-1}[U],\\tau_U,U\\times F,\\tau_{U\\times F})\\land\\forall e\\in p^{-1}[U]\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{pr}_1(\\phi_U(e))=p(e)\\bigr)\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fiber bundle: locally product, globally twisted</li>\n<li>局部同胚现在显式使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^{-1}[U]\">\\(p^{-1}[U]\\)</span> 上的子空间拓扑与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\times F\">\\(U\\times F\\)</span> 上的乘积拓扑。</li>\n<li>Vector bundle: fiber is a vector space</li>\n<li>Principal bundle: fiber is group <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span></li>\n<li>Classifying space: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BG\">\\(BG\\)</span> classifies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>-bundles</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Vector Bundles and K-Theory</li>\n<li>Steenrod, The Topology of Fiber Bundles</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-projection.md","status":"resolved","id":"e8edb0ea1617bd4e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-projection.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\